<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0F172A', padding: 60, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ marginBottom: 28 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#22D3EE', letterSpacing: 2 }}>3D 内容生产的核心矛盾</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 8 }}>写故事的人，造不出世界</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: 'rgba(79,70,229,0.5)', marginTop: 16 }} />
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 360, background: '#4F46E5', borderRadius: 12, padding: 32, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>创意 → 3D 之间，隔着一条「生产流水线」</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>会写故事的人，大多不会建模；会建模的人，又不在写故事。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 22 }}>
      <Box style={{ paddingBottom: 20, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.25)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F0ABFC' }}>01 门槛高</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>Blender / 建模 / 绑定，非专业者寸步难行，创意被工具劝退。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ paddingBottom: 20, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.25)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F0ABFC' }}>02 链路长</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>一个角色从想法到可交互，要跨 4+ 工具，反复导出导入。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ paddingBottom: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F0ABFC' }}>03 难复用</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>故事改一句，场景重做一遍，叙事与资产无法解耦。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ marginTop: 22, padding: 14, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.12)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>StoryLight3D 要拆掉的，正是「写」与「造」之间的那堵墙。</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 14, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>StoryLight3D · Aholo 3D 黑客松</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>02 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
